+	depends on V4L_PLATFORM_DRIVERS
+	depends on VIDEO_DEV
+	select VIDEOBUF2_VMALLOC
+	help
+	  V4L2 capture driver for the Axiado AX3000 SoC display capture
+	  controller. The controller has no MMIO registers; frames written
