 .../dts/rockchip/rk3399-vicharak-vaaman.dts   | 454 ++++++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 455 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 arch/arm64/boot/dts/rockchip/rk3399-vicharak-vaaman.dts

